183: ## Seams
184: 
185: ### Picked up from Music, grades 6 to 8
186: 
187: Each Level 1 row assumes its grade 8 row (data/progressions/arts.csv). Music, grades 6 to 8 is a band course whose
188: grade 8 year ends that course; its unit numbers are not cited here. Level 1 meets each as a readiness check (see
189: Readiness and retrieval) after the bridge has taught its techniques and words.
