218: ### Where the threads end
219: 
220: Music 9 to 12 is the last music course. Level 3 ends the claimed ids; Level 4's four rows (mu-g12-studio,
221: mu-g12-perform, mu-g12-criticism, mu-g12-connect) hand on nothing (their `hands_on` cells are empty): the
222: threads end in the student's portfolio, program, reviews and capstone, which the student keeps. A student who
223: stops after any level has a complete course at that level. The ensemble companion page points to music after
224: school (community ensembles, further study).
