278: Each check day: set-up 3 minutes, the student's self-check 5, the sitting 35 (two unseen excerpts, each heard
279: twice from the teacher's device or performed from the score card), collecting 2. One adult proctors one room. Every
280: student's evidence is collected once in a window; no product is scored twice. Days above are band course days
281: (Level 2 starts on day 161, Level 3 on day 321, Level 4 on day 481). On the short path the same checks fall on days
282: 39 and 40 (week 8) and 79 and 80 (week 16) of the level.
