ked met, partly or not yet. Out: composing from an outside idea with no set form (Level 1). Tools: staff paper, the tension-line card, the form card, Curio Class's own. Free path: the chord roots sung. Once-a-week path: 6 sessions | After unit 10 because tension and release are a way of carrying intent, just backed with evidence; before unit 12, which revises and presents this piece. Hands the composing threads to Level 1 | Candidate: a living Native American composer's expanded-form work beside the three, for range | Finlandia: its tune later took words as a hymn and a national song; told as a fact, no hymn sung. The Butterfly Lovers tells a folk tale of two lovers who die and become butterflies: told in one sentence, read first by the agent. Pair work: as unit 3. Hazards and controls: as unit 3. Agent reads: sensitivity; safety (hands-on). |
