## Cross-subject

Two music rows of grades 6 to 8 carry a cross_subject lean (data/progressions/arts.csv): mu-g6-respond on ELA's
SL.6.1 and mu-g8-respond on ELA's W.8.1. Both are core courses (lesson 32); each lean is practiced, not owned, and
each has its "if later" line. STANDARD.md 6's music and math lean (note values as fractions) ended in grade 5
(mu-g5-read, math:5.NF.A.1); here dotted notes and ties are read as music signs only.

