|---|---|---|---|
| Unit 1 (year 6, days 1 to 18, weeks 1 to 9): talk about the listening works and the critique (mu-g6-respond) | SL.6.1 (discussion with evidence: coming prepared, rules and roles, questions, paraphrase) | ELA grade 6 unit 1 (days 1 to 32), which teaches the discussion routine (SL.6.1a to d) in weeks 1 to 7 | The music unit's discussion card gives the routine itself (come with the listening log marked, one speaker, a question back, say what you heard the last speaker say) and the teacher models it on the first listening day; nothing in the talk is scored as ELA |

