### Physical education, health and dance (boundaries)

Students move only to show a music idea (conducting a meter, body percussion, clapping a pattern); they do not dance
(the samba de roda circle and the powwow are studied by watching), since dance is its own course and its motor skill
is physical education's (STANDARD.md 6). Changing voices are named as a normal change in the safety bullet only; why
voices change is health's to teach, and no music unit teaches it. No lean either way.

### Social studies, grades 6 to 8

The settings of works (Tuva, Senegal, Ethiopia, Lebanon, Brazil, China, Korea) are taught by each unit on its own work cards (bar
criterion 7), using social studies' sourcing habit of who, when, where and for what; the unit teaches the setting
it uses itself. No lean either way.

